        "text": "**Constructing Stream Generator**\n\nI'm currently focused on developing `stream_platform_generation.py`. My primary goal is to create a file that efficiently streams output from AWS Bedrock, while preserving important provider response objects. This approach ensures I maintain all necessary data.\n\n\n",
