        "text": "**Adapting Platform Metadata**\n\nI'm currently working on integrating platform metadata, like usage and resource IDs, into the model output. The plan is to modify `invoke_bedrock_model` to return this information alongside the model response. My primary focus is on how to best adapt the function to efficiently include this new data.\n\n\n",
